PNV 1
EPISTEMIC CHYBA
MODE READ_ONLY

# PNCS v0.17 written form is a projection of already registered semantic content.
# It does not introduce a parser opcode or textual semantic authority.
# The IDENTITY witnesses below record round-trip identity only.

OP W17.PREDICATE.SOURCE SOURCE pncs:def:sha256:registered-predicate
OP W17.PREDICATE.PROJECT COMPOSITION W17.PREDICATE.SOURCE written.pncs.0.17
OP W17.PREDICATE.RECONSTRUCT COMPOSITION written.pncs.0.17 W17.PREDICATE.SOURCE
OP W17.PREDICATE.IDENTITY IDENTITY W17.PREDICATE.SOURCE W17.PREDICATE.RECONSTRUCT

OP W17.BRANCH.SOURCE SOURCE pncs:def:sha256:registered-internal-branch
OP W17.BRANCH.PROJECT COMPOSITION W17.BRANCH.SOURCE written.pncs.0.17
OP W17.BRANCH.RECONSTRUCT COMPOSITION written.pncs.0.17 W17.BRANCH.SOURCE
OP W17.BRANCH.IDENTITY IDENTITY W17.BRANCH.SOURCE W17.BRANCH.RECONSTRUCT

ASSERT W17.PREDICATE.IDENTITY
ASSERT W17.BRANCH.IDENTITY
EMIT W17.PREDICATE.IDENTITY
EMIT W17.BRANCH.IDENTITY
